              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo nteeka etteeka nga buli muntu ow'eggwanga lyonna, na buli muntu ow'olulimi lwonna olwa buli ngeri alyogera obubi ku Katonda wa Saddulaaki, ne Mesaki ne Abeduneego, alitemebwatemebwa, n'ennyumba ye erimenyebwamenyebwa, kubanga tewali katonda mulala ayinza okuwonya mu ngeri eyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
